msgid "1 byte bitmap of which EKF2 instances will use the output from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator that has been turned on by the EK2\\_GSF\\_RUN\\_MASK parameter\\. If the inertial navigation calculation stops following the GPS\\, then the vehicle code can request EKF2 to attempt to resolve the issue\\, either by performing a yaw reset if enabled by this parameter by switching to another EKF2 instance\\."
