msgid "EK3\\_HRT\\_FILT: Height rate filter crossover frequency"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43734
#: a2564edcf7794800b3742c91bac34d59
msgid "EK3\\_MAG\\_EF\\_LIM: EarthField error limit"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43753
#: 6a4e8612629e493292c200c7c2e638e8
msgid "EK3\\_GSF\\_RUN\\_MASK: Bitmask of which EKF\\-GSF yaw estimators run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43758
#: fc3e8625370348aead1d3930724db434
msgid "1 byte bitmap of which EKF3 instances run an independent EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator to provide a backup yaw estimate that doesn\\'t rely on magnetometer data\\. This estimator uses IMU\\, GPS and\\, if available\\, airspeed data\\. EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator data for the primary EKF3 instance will be logged as GSF0 and GSF1 messages\\. Use of the yaw estimate generated by this algorithm is controlled by the EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK and EK3\\_GSF\\_RST\\_MAX parameters\\. To run the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator in ride\\-along and logging only\\, set EK3\\_GSF\\_USE to 0\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43788
#: b661f322dee44455a829efdfcfced438
msgid "EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK: Bitmask of which EKF\\-GSF yaw estimators are used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43793
#: a1c5df9f95e246aa857283ead55afc09
msgid "A bitmask of which EKF3 instances will use the output from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator that has been turned on by the EK3\\_GSF\\_RUN\\_MASK parameter\\. If the inertial navigation calculation stops following the GPS\\, then the vehicle code can request EKF3 to attempt to resolve the issue\\, either by performing a yaw reset if enabled by this parameter by switching to another EKF3 instance\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43823
#: da8b5c825b7c4aed8dabd1bceb653ec9
msgid "EK3\\_GSF\\_RST\\_MAX: Maximum number of resets to the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimate allowed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43828
#: 0b2cc29466fc49fd868a0f0406870a5d
msgid "Sets the maximum number of times the EKF3 will be allowed to reset its yaw to the estimate from the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimator\\. No resets will be allowed unless the use of the EKF\\-GSF yaw estimate is enabled via the EK3\\_GSF\\_USE\\_MASK parameter\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43843
#: 32fae43ea92c492188884399b0dca5e7
msgid "EK3\\_ERR\\_THRESH: EKF3 Lane Relative Error Sensitivity Threshold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43847
#: 823efcc89e0b49f8a42c1ebd26165b05
msgid "lanes have to be consistently better than the primary by at least this threshold to reduce their overall relativeCoreError\\, lowering this makes lane switching more sensitive to smaller error differences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43853
#: 46e412bf70c6403396eecf381a69a9bd
msgid "0.05 to 1"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43862
#: 8c51fcf274c7490eb016f76138301f7e
msgid "EK3\\_AFFINITY: EKF3 Sensor Affinity Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43867
#: 5cffe7e129a042a19e5ff24156f3cb5c
msgid "These options control the affinity between sensor instances and EKF cores"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:43876
