#: 372f615bbaa646159a596889d5f778c1
msgid "Min collective"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49644
#: b3cf68214b41427ea7440c7ced50ccc3
msgid "H\\_CYC\\_MAX: Maximum Cyclic Pitch Angle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49647
#: f9ae13372fd74e98a3f79b345723c9e6
msgid "Maximum cyclic pitch angle of the swash plate\\.  There are no units to this parameter\\.  This should be adjusted to get the desired cyclic blade pitch for the pitch and roll axes\\.  Typically this should be 6\\-7 deg \\(measured blade pitch angle difference between stick centered and stick max deflection\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49662
#: a7a23962296045aea3e94022f640ab8e
msgid "H\\_SV\\_TEST: Boot\\-up Servo Test Cycles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49665
#: 933fdbb89edd424dacf8eefc236ed403
msgid "Number of cycles to run servo test on boot\\-up"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49680
#: ea507a6be8f24f8891ce2084e70fc4a1
msgid "H\\_COL\\_HOVER: Collective Hover Value"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49684
#: 1021bf5f9c9e47a19795ae7b1e8efe3f
msgid "Collective needed to hover expressed as a number from 0 to 1 where 0 is H\\_COL\\_MIN and 1 is H\\_COL\\_MAX"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49690
#: d1ee661eb10d4bc2b54d61f8561c5902
msgid "0.3 to 0.8"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49699
#: 56da2adecca349a887dab244dcec64b4
msgid "H\\_HOVER\\_LEARN: Hover Value Learning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49703
#: 60844309114a465b82212a27f852a33a
msgid "Enable\\/Disable automatic learning of hover collective"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49714
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:65152
#: ca5f00e0d7794bf6b77cd0f4f31d089f
#: a84efb10592e44c7a89f1cd054dbc100
msgid "Learn"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49716
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:65154
#: ab1d88ec403040ce878cc88c915bca9b
#: e63dbd95510f433f8215a5d5013ed625
msgid "Learn and Save"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49727
#: 955fc479494349acacd6d61bd20a2af9
msgid "H\\_OPTIONS: Heli\\_Options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49730
#: 743f2d5e49a942f690d28d9cbed527d3
msgid "Bitmask of heli options\\.  Bit 0 changes how the pitch\\, roll\\, and yaw axis integrator term is managed for low speed and takeoff\\/landing\\. In AC 4\\.0 and earlier\\, scheme uses a leaky integrator for ground speeds less than 5 m\\/s and won\\'t let the steady state integrator build above ILMI\\. The integrator is allowed to build to the ILMI value when it is landed\\.  The other integrator management scheme bases integrator limiting on takeoff and landing\\.  Whenever the aircraft is landed the integrator is set to zero\\.  When the aicraft is airborne\\, the integrator is only limited by IMAX\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49739
#: fe52b6b65d89467695273b24c9f45852
msgid "Use Leaky I"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49750
#: 7d92f52e209d486c91a2759ca9ac0db7
msgid "H\\_COL\\_ANG\\_MIN: Collective Blade Pitch Angle Minimum"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49753
#: cee831019db8488a83912fce7460c59c
msgid "Minimum collective blade pitch angle in deg that corresponds to the PWM set for minimum collective pitch \\(H\\_COL\\_MIN\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49759
#: f732c567618544a8ba1643d90bb16788
msgid "-20 to 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49768
#: 1f8d5669a7f94eb3b3e3f734bf0d630c
msgid "H\\_COL\\_ANG\\_MAX: Collective Blade Pitch Angle Maximum"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49771
#: c499d33ff22f4d12affba9257ec79aa2
msgid "Maximum collective blade pitch angle in deg that corresponds to the PWM set for maximum collective pitch \\(H\\_COL\\_MAX\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49777
#: c99ab6b0c05c43abb98f26ad24e03863
msgid "5 to 20"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49786
#: d788babec2524ba7890bba8ad94550b5
msgid "H\\_COL\\_ZERO\\_THRST: Collective Blade Pitch at Zero Thrust"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49789
#: 73ac10329c2b4ac18d3f6b8e5a90df9b
msgid "Collective blade pitch angle at zero thrust in degrees\\. For symetric airfoil blades this value is zero deg\\. For chambered airfoil blades this value is typically negative\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49795
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49813
#: ec6c44190f294c4b87f1b730364e4897
#: 2764ba5dcfd54eeb806f4fbcaa125bbc
msgid "-5 to 0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49804
#: 6887a33c00f64b81bf6625b4d4875518
msgid "H\\_COL\\_LAND\\_MIN: Collective Blade Pitch Minimum when Landed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49807
#: 80a3e019ac75483396dc51094356833f
msgid "Minimum collective blade pitch angle when landed in degrees for non\\-manual collective modes \\(i\\.e\\. modes that use altitude hold\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49823
#: 94f237d982d7459c81888bbd7c7fceb5
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_ Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49829
#: 515d2f75863a4f1a82b6466b618201cd
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_SETPOINT: External Motor Governor Setpoint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49832
#: 8c8f33fbafe746a79ec60ccb6865fa0a
msgid "Throttle \\(HeliRSC Servo\\) output in percent to the external motor governor when motor interlock enabled \\(throttle hold off\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49847
#: d333022e625442a58171e8454dab1e37
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_MODE: Rotor Speed Control Mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49850
#: c3647440e52147fa98dfceaf8bf01625
msgid "Selects the type of rotor speed control used to determine throttle output to the HeliRSC servo channel when motor interlock is enabled \\(throttle hold off\\)\\. RC Passthrough sends the input from the RC Motor Interlock channel as throttle output\\.  External Gov SetPoint sends the RSC SetPoint parameter value as throttle output\\.  Throttle Curve uses the 5 point throttle curve to determine throttle output based on the collective output\\.  AutoThrottle requires a rotor speed sensor\\, contains an advanced autothrottle governor and is primarily for piston and turbine engines\\. WARNING\\: Throttle ramp time and throttle curve MUST be tuned properly using Throttle Curve mode before using AutoThrottle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49859
#: a76780313314416d910ec0ef13c42f07
msgid "RC Passthrough"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49861
#: e601f679f16747989c31ab3f5de20f51
msgid "External Gov SetPoint"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49863
#: 79f507dc96f34b4a84b4fec1849a6754
msgid "Throttle Curve"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49865
#: 666e1f042a3e4a3198aa717227eaa2cd
msgid "AutoThrottle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49876
#: 0b2273e3563f432ca1e8ade54f0d4e33
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_RAMP\\_TIME: Throttle Ramp Time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49879
#: 42795a5eb4a34e4bbc9e0f9d637de415
msgid "Time in seconds for throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) to ramp from ground idle \\(RSC\\_IDLE\\) to flight idle throttle setting when motor interlock is enabled \\(throttle hold off\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49885
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49903
#: 21c48a13feda4fddaf97f24cdb69b837
#: f8eb549dc6a64bbaab4b61d077f8c576
msgid "0 to 60"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49894
#: e1ced4dbb64d4f1bba65e2368564bac8
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_RUNUP\\_TIME: Rotor Runup Time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49897
#: bcda9cee3cf14a98a1fb815576b47045
msgid "Actual time in seconds for the main rotor to reach full speed after motor interlock is enabled \\(throttle hold off\\)\\. Must be at least one second longer than the Throttle Ramp Time that is set with RSC\\_RAMP\\_TIME\\. WARNING\\: For AutoThrottle users with piston and turbine engines it is VERY important to know how long it takes to warm up your engine and reach full rotor speed when throttle switch is turned ON\\. This timer should be set for at least the amount of time it takes to get your helicopter to full flight power\\, ready for takeoff\\. Failure to heed this warning could result in the auto\\-takeoff mode attempting to lift up into hover before the engine has reached full power\\, and subsequent loss of control"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49912
#: 7128fe9df4144ac1896fd92bac455256
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_CRITICAL: Critical Rotor Speed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49915
#: c4858f4f687c4957ad4c5db5ad8cff95
msgid "Percentage of normal rotor speed where flight is no longer possible\\. However currently the rotor runup\\/rundown is estimated using the RSC\\_RUNUP\\_TIME parameter\\.   Estimated rotor speed increases\\/decreases between 0 \\(rotor stopped\\) to 1 \\(rotor at normal speed\\) in the RSC\\_RUNUP\\_TIME in seconds\\. This parameter should be set so that the estimated rotor speed goes below critical in approximately 3 seconds\\.  So if you had a 10 second runup time then set RSC\\_CRITICAL to 70\\%\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49930
#: 3e2c225cfaa547b3868f8cdb6724f26f
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_IDLE: Throttle Output at Idle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49933
#: eb66e3d4b7124f84a4b3b3f5a4d8de04
msgid "Throttle output \\(HeliRSC Servo\\) in percent while armed but motor interlock is disabled \\(throttle hold on\\)\\. FOR COMBUSTION ENGINES\\. Sets the engine ground idle throttle percentage with clutch disengaged\\. This must be set to zero for electric helicopters under most situations\\. If the ESC has an autorotation window this can be set to keep the autorotation window open in the ESC\\. Consult the operating manual for your ESC to set it properly for this purpose"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49948
#: 25550491eebc495090b4988655580469
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_SLEWRATE: Throttle Slew Rate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49951
#: ca1f94e38cff4c99977dfd7ca47c7d33
msgid "This controls the maximum rate at which the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) can change\\, as a percentage per second\\. A value of 100 means the throttle can change over its full range in one second\\. A value of zero gives unlimited slew rate\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49966
#: 5959b9094655434680a9cbe22cb3dd3f
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_THRCRV\\_0: Throttle Curve at 0\\% Coll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49969
#: abb23a9e1d234cffa1a86ed3df2e1f5b
msgid "Sets the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) in percent for the throttle curve at the minimum collective pitch position\\. The 0 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MIN\\. Example\\: if the setup has \\-2 degree to \\+10 degree collective pitch setup\\, this setting would correspond to \\-2 degree of pitch\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49984
#: a36da65c71894c3f9a0294e0f0eb958c
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_THRCRV\\_25: Throttle Curve at 25\\% Coll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:49987
#: 89f973cca54b4149b8220fc87c2b384c
msgid "Sets the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) in percent for the throttle curve at 25\\% of full collective travel where he 0 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MIN and 100 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MAX\\.  Example\\: if the setup has \\-2 degree to \\+10 degree collective pitch setup\\, the total range is 12 degrees\\. 25\\% of 12 degrees is 3 degrees\\, so this setting would correspond to \\+1 degree of pitch\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50002
#: 84fd6b19599043659d51d47597a42570
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_THRCRV\\_50: Throttle Curve at 50\\% Coll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50005
#: 0e9706ad12754eab966c4422834514e3
msgid "Sets the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) in percent for the throttle curve at 50\\% of full collective travel where he 0 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MIN and 100 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MAX\\.  Example\\: if the setup has \\-2 degree to \\+10 degree collective pitch setup\\, the total range is 12 degrees\\. 50\\% of 12 degrees is 6 degrees\\, so this setting would correspond to \\+4 degree of pitch\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50020
#: e171953010424d46a1a63c4e7c9d90ec
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_THRCRV\\_75: Throttle Curve at 75\\% Coll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50023
#: ebb3cbc79f0f46d98adc43d8dcc35790
msgid "Sets the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) in percent for the throttle curve at 75\\% of full collective travel where he 0 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MIN and 100 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MAX\\.  Example\\: if the setup has \\-2 degree to \\+10 degree collective pitch setup\\, the total range is 12 degrees\\. 75\\% of 12 degrees is 9 degrees\\, so this setting would correspond to \\+7 degree of pitch\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50038
#: caee11b230a8431381d9f616c264dab9
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_THRCRV\\_100: Throttle Curve at 100\\% Coll"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50041
#: 016568c49d324d10a9696ae4d08d1608
msgid "Sets the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) in percent for the throttle curve at the minimum collective pitch position\\. The 100 percent collective is defined by H\\_COL\\_MAX\\.  Example\\: if the setup has \\-2 degree to \\+10 degree collective pitch setup\\, this setting would correspond to \\+10 degree of pitch\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50056
#: 57b954b91c094a4d961b4e388cea4aff
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_RANGE: Governor Operational Range"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50059
#: f0dcd3be8fae4354855698a429b1aaa3
msgid "RPM range \\+\\/\\- governor rpm reference setting where governor is operational\\. If speed sensor fails or rpm falls outside of this range\\, the governor will disengage and return to throttle curve\\. Recommended range is 100"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50074
#: 326789aa9fef49639dc269eaca9365e2
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_CLDWN\\_TIME: Cooldown Time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50077
#: 587096f200834e71abd9331a7ae0f672
msgid "Will provide a fast idle for engine cooldown by raising the Ground Idle speed setting by 50\\% for the number of seconds the timer is set for\\. A setting of zero disables the fast idle\\. This feature will only apply after the runup complete has been declared\\. This will not extend the time before ground idle is declared\\, which triggers engine shutdown for autonomous landings\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50092
#: 43918bce14b746e4a1af2233d9035d3d
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_COMP: Governor Torque Compensator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50095
#: 6c22a73c3c2f40bf95abeeeeaaaf7fdd
msgid "Adjusts the autothrottle governor torque compensator that determines how fast the governor will adjust the base torque reference to compensate for changes in density altitude\\. If RPM is low or high by more than 2\\-5 RPM\\, increase this setting by 1\\% at a time until the governor speed matches your RPM setting\\. Setting the compensator too high can result in surging and throttle \\\"hunting\\\"\\. Do not make large adjustments at one time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50101
#: 1c87f4e4d1164ab2a2b9a500cdefa847
msgid "0 to 70"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50110
#: aa995b0ab7274862a60c7d9eda4182ea
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_DROOP: Governor Droop Compensator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50113
#: 906b30d3e42d4c728184f03f23dadac9
msgid "AutoThrottle governor droop response under load\\, normal settings of 0\\-50\\%\\. Higher value is quicker response to large speed changes due to load but may cause surging\\. Adjust this to be as aggressive as possible without getting surging or RPM over\\-run when the governor responds to large load changes on the rotor system"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50128
#: a3f0bacb52e7433ca9f7681965f45a84
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_FF: Governor Feedforward"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50131
#: 0f40e5d449374edabce37ffeb1a0cfec
msgid "Feedforward governor gain to throttle response during sudden loading\\/unloading of the rotor system\\. If RPM drops excessively during full collective climb with the droop response set correctly\\, increase the governor feedforward\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50146
#: 836ba28b1e2f4227bfa9d42670a656e1
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_RPM: Rotor RPM Setting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50149
#: 896da61b44284a9bbd2342d0be29b968
msgid "Main rotor RPM that governor maintains when engaged"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50155
#: 86635e5cfc254f4a923f073fafcd67f4
msgid "800 to 3500"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50164
#: 036ad2d7c62246ecaf1941633e20e4b8
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_GOV\\_TORQUE: Governor Torque Limiter"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50167
#: 48bb09177e87429ca578fa889dcdf4eb
msgid "Adjusts the engine\\'s percentage of torque rise on autothrottle during ramp\\-up to governor speed\\. The torque rise will determine how fast the rotor speed will ramp up when rotor speed reaches 50\\% of the rotor RPM setting\\. The sequence of events engaging the governor is as follows\\: Throttle ramp time will engage the clutch and start the main rotor turning\\. The collective should be at flat pitch and the throttle curve set to provide at least 50\\% of normal RPM at flat pitch\\. The autothrottle torque limiter will automatically activate and start accelerating the main rotor\\. If the autothrottle consistently fails to accelerate the main rotor during ramp\\-in due to engine tune or other factors\\, then increase the torque limiter setting\\. NOTE\\: throttle ramp time and throttle curve should be tuned using RSC\\_MODE Throttle Curve before using RSC\\_MODE AutoThrottle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50173
#: 6db1d19f3ce14f58b8c7002a07d80cb9
msgid "10 to 60"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50183
#: ab3988a4998045d98b7a40d977b3456e
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_ Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50189
#: c800ab836d664a3f8a4b5a8f303cefc2
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_ENBL: Enable autorotation handling in RSC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50192
#: aa1f0da91deb481589c85b5d44c0490f
msgid "Allows you to enable \\(1\\) or disable \\(0\\) the autorotation functionality within the Rotor Speed Controller\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50214
#: cb1e14a1f2664289a9c3fa6c85e78a5e
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_RAMP: Time for in\\-flight power re\\-engagement when exiting autorotations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50217
#: c23a43ae259340c6a519771e8d8eac04
msgid "When exiting an autorotation in a bailout manoeuvre\\, this is the time in seconds for the throttle output \\(HeliRSC servo\\) to ramp from idle \\(H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_IDLE\\) to flight throttle setting when motor interlock is re\\-enabled\\. When using an ESC with an autorotation bailout function\\, this parameter should be set to 0\\.1 \\(minimum value\\)\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50232
#: 0cf795310fa34b34954e2b765a5650a3
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_IDLE: Idle throttle percentage during autorotation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50235
#: a7fe842e40774dc2abc70ce6c23477a0
msgid "Idle throttle used for during autotoration\\. For external governors\\, this would be set to a value that is within the autorotation window of the governer\\/ESC to enable fast spool\\-up\\, when bailing out of an autorotation\\.  Set 0 to disable\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50250
#: 7a2341a4e802466bb4d68e4bbcd77234
msgid "H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_RUNUP: Time allowed for in\\-flight power re\\-engagement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50253
#: 0be153dc4473458097c8e1cce8f915df
msgid "When exiting an autorotation in a bailout manoeuvre\\, this is the expected time in seconds for the main rotor to reach full speed after motor interlock is enabled\\. Must be at least one second longer than the H\\_RSC\\_AROT\\_RAMP time that is set\\. This timer should be set for at least the amount of time it takes to get your helicopter to full flight power\\. Failure to heed this warning could result in early entry into autonomously controlled collective modes \\(e\\.g\\. alt hold\\, loiter\\, etc\\)\\, whereby the collective could be raised before the engine has reached full power\\, with a subsequently dangerous slowing of head speed\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50269
#: 3818138fccbf4548b5a94954e9768271
msgid "IM\\_ Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50275
#: 0e39504598d14be4aa587ba2945c426f
msgid "IM\\_ACRO\\_COL\\_EXP: Acro Mode Collective Expo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50279
#: 41d23c66946e4dd5a711efa70ee1c7cf
msgid "Used to soften collective pitch inputs near center point in Acro mode\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50309
#: f6497d03a71b4f93af80a25ba5f2fe8a
msgid "IM\\_STB\\_COL\\_1: Stabilize Collective Low"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50312
#: 5a9a1a7b33e244fa8bacc925243b97a7
msgid "Helicopter\\'s minimum collective pitch setting at zero collective stick input in Stabilize mode\\.  Set this as a percent of collective range given by H\\_COL\\_MAX minus H\\_COL\\_MIN\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50327
#: 3318c300920f423c91fcf91d4bdf8218
msgid "IM\\_STB\\_COL\\_2: Stabilize Collective Mid\\-Low"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50330
#: 68dfd6c7c6ab45708a7787b0ed07a600
msgid "Helicopter\\'s collective pitch setting at mid\\-low \\(40\\%\\) collective stick input in Stabilize mode\\. Set this as a percent of collective range given by H\\_COL\\_MAX minus H\\_COL\\_MIN\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50345
#: 36ad77d9623941cc9425b10348b2ef16
msgid "IM\\_STB\\_COL\\_3: Stabilize Collective Mid\\-High"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50348
#: 361b83e2294349cc9b9380b04c42bc52
msgid "Helicopter\\'s collective pitch setting at mid\\-high \\(60\\%\\) collective stick input in Stabilize mode\\. Set this as a percent of collective range given by H\\_COL\\_MAX minus H\\_COL\\_MIN\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50363
#: 5ccd7eeb4c20429b9e5d0a27970a7451
msgid "IM\\_STB\\_COL\\_4: Stabilize Collective High"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50366
#: 5ef1e61e561e4c9296e7e83ef6f33461
msgid "Helicopter\\'s maximum collective pitch setting at full collective stick input in Stabilize mode\\. Set this as a percent of collective range given by H\\_COL\\_MAX minus H\\_COL\\_MIN\\."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50382
#: bd548a7d72664754a36316587778c8cb
msgid "INS Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50388
#: dc0591d843dd4153ab47c2eba84b2d2a
msgid "INS\\_GYROFFS\\_X: Gyro offsets of X axis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:50392
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:51933
#: ../../source/docs/parameters.rst:52686
#: f0e30bc7478a436e88cf869da3b3b7fc
