msgid "The baud rate used for Serial7\\. Most stm32\\-based boards can support rates of up to 1500\\. If you setup a rate you cannot support and then can\\'t connect to your board you should load a firmware from a different vehicle type\\. That will reset all your parameters to defaults\\."
